# The damage spells, cast by Cherub (52, a mage) and, for the clerics' spells a mage can't learn, Smokegod (60), both
# neutral, with every skill at 100 and mana to spare. Only area_update runs, so each victim strikes back once. At the
# entrance to Mud School (3700, indoors); both are immortal, so no hit leaves them below 1. Each cast is waited out.
# - acid blast, burning hands, the three cause spells, colour spray (which can blind), fireball and flamestrike, each
#   on a fresh drunk (3064, good) or septon (9006, which resists fire)
# - chain lightning arcing through a room of mobs and back to Cherub
# - demonfire turning on a caster who isn't evil, then cast by an evil Smokegod
# - dispel evil on a goblin (3501, evil), a drunk (good: Mota protects it) and a fido (neutral); dispel good the same
# - energy drain on a duck (3124, level 1: drains its life whole) and on a septon (its mana and moves)
# - earthquake, which a flying pet dragon (350) rides out; call lightning indoors, and outdoors under a clear sky
@connect cher
Cherub
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
set skill cherub all 100
set char cherub mana 30000
restore cherub
set skill smokegod all 100
set char smokegod mana 30000
restore smokegod
transfer cherub 3700
goto 3700
@as cher
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'acid blast' drunk
@pulse 24
@mob 3064 3700
cast 'burning hands' drunk
@pulse 24
@mob 9006 3700
cast 'colour spray' septon
@pulse 24
cast fireball septon
@pulse 24
@as god
cast 'cause light' septon
@pulse 24
cast 'cause serious' septon
@pulse 24
cast 'cause critical' septon
@pulse 24
cast flamestrike septon
@pulse 24
@as god
slay septon
@mob 3064 3700
@mob 3062 3700
@mob 3501 3700
@mob 3124 3700
@as cher
cast 'chain lightning' drunk
@pulse 24
@state
@as god
peace
@mob 3501 3700
@mob 3064 3700
@mob 3062 3700
cast demonfire drunk
@pulse 24
peace
set char smokegod align -1000
cast demonfire drunk
@pulse 24
peace
set char smokegod align 0
cast 'dispel evil' goblin
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel evil' 2.drunk
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel evil' fido
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel good' 2.drunk
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel good' goblin
@pulse 24
cast 'dispel good' fido
@pulse 24
peace
@mob 3124 3700
@mob 9006 3700
@as cher
cast 'energy drain' duck
@pulse 24
cast 'energy drain' septon
@pulse 24
@as god
peace
@mob 350 3700
@as god
cast earthquake
@pulse 24
peace
@as cher
cast 'call lightning'
@pulse 24
@as god
transfer cherub 3005
@as cher
cast 'call lightning'
@pulse 24
@state
